%% Request Lifecycle — End-to-End Sequence Diagram
%% Traces a job from API call through to completion

sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant API as Orchestrator API<br/>(workflow.controller)
    participant Orch as Orchestration<br/>(orchestration.service)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL<br/>(dtm_jobs/steps)
    participant SQS as SQS Queue<br/>(LocalStack)
    participant Poller as SQS Poller
    participant Worker as Lambda Worker
    participant CB as Callback Service
    participant Kafka as Kafka
    participant ACK as Dev ACK Simulator
    participant Cascade as Cascade Publish

    Note over Client,Cascade: Phase 1: Job Initiation
    Client->>API: POST /api/v1/workflows/:name/jobs
    API->>DB: Create job (PENDING)
    API->>DB: Create all steps (PENDING)
    API->>DB: Update job → PROCESSING
    API->>Orch: continueJob(jobId)
    Orch->>DB: Fetch steps, classify
    Orch->>DB: findReadySteps() → root steps
    Orch->>SQS: delegateStep(s) → send to SQS
    Orch->>DB: Update steps → DELEGATED
    API-->>Client: { jobId, workflowName, variant }

    Note over Client,Cascade: Phase 2: Worker Execution
    Poller->>SQS: Long-poll for messages
    SQS-->>Poller: Step message
    Poller->>Worker: Route to handler via registry
    Worker->>CB: POST callback (in_progress)
    CB->>DB: Update step → IN_PROGRESS
    Worker->>Worker: Query source DB, process
    Worker->>CB: POST callback (completed + output)

    Note over Client,Cascade: Phase 3: ACK & Cascade
    CB->>DB: Update step output/records
    CB->>Kafka: Publish cascade.completed
    CB->>DB: Update step → WAITING_FOR_ACK
    ACK->>Kafka: Listen on cascade.completed
    ACK->>Kafka: Publish cascade.ack (with externalId)
    Kafka-->>CB: ACK received
    CB->>DB: Update step → COMPLETED (ack_metadata)
    CB->>Cascade: checkAndPublishCascade()
    Cascade->>DB: Inject FK into dependent step inputs
    CB->>Orch: continueJob(jobId)
    Orch->>DB: findReadySteps() → newly unblocked steps
    Orch->>SQS: delegateStep(s)

    Note over Client,Cascade: Phase 2-3 repeat for each step...

    Note over Client,Cascade: Phase 4: Job Completion
    Orch->>DB: All steps terminal
    Orch->>Orch: evaluateOutcome() if failures
    Orch->>DB: Update job → COMPLETED/PARTIAL_SUCCESS/FAILED
    Orch->>Kafka: Publish job.completed event

    Note over Client,Cascade: Client polls for status
    Client->>API: GET /api/v1/workflows/{name}/jobs/{jobId}
    API->>DB: Fetch job + steps
    API-->>Client: { status, steps[] }
